---

# Folder Responsibilities

app/api/

Only Route Handlers.

No business logic.

---

services/

Business logic.

Database operations.

Cloudinary.

Brevo.

Authentication.

---

models/

Mongoose Schemas only.

Never place queries here.

---

lib/

Configurations.

Database connection.

Cloudinary configuration.

JWT helpers.

Logger.

Environment validation.

---

middleware/

Authentication middleware only.

---

utils/

Reusable helper functions.

No feature-specific logic.

---

# Route Handler Rules

Each Route Handler should:

Validate request

↓

Call service

↓

Return response

Nothing else.

